      <glyph class="complex" compartmentRef="ca1" id="csa23">
         <notes>
            <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
               <head>
                  <title/>
               </head>
               <body>Previous Symbols: Synonyms: A multimeric complex which consists of flavoprotein (subunit A ; InterPro:IPR003952), iron-sulfur protein (subunit B) and membrane-bound cytochrome b560 (subunit C; InterPro:IPR000701). In some Archaea, the membrane-bound subunits (C or C and D) do not necessarily contain heme. Membrane-bound subunits can bind or react with quinones.</body>
            </html>
         </notes>
