      <glyph class="complex" compartmentRef="ca1" id="csa25">
         <notes>
            <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
               <head>
                  <title/>
               </head>
               <body>Previous Symbols: Synonyms: A part of the respiratory chain, containing the 13 polypeptide subunits of cytochrome c oxidase, including cytochrome a and cytochrome a3. Catalyzes the oxidation of reduced cytochrome c by dioxygen (O2).</body>
            </html>
         </notes>
