PMID:19393246
in Hela, COX17 siRNA interferes with copper loading into MT-CO2
PMID:18458339
detailed description of COX17 mediated copper loading of SCO proteins, and interactions with the disulfide based modifications of these proteins
a_re93(MAP:apoptosis):
PMID:15119951
SURF1 mutations are associated with Leigh syndrome (cytochrome oxidase deficiency)
PMID:11389896
SURF1 Homolog of Yeast (Shy) is necessary for COX assembly and stability
PMID:19625251
Paroccocus denitrificans SURF1 homologs were proposed to promote heme a insertion into COX subunit 1
References_end
